    "chunk_text": "nu on God \u00dea wear\u00f0 Martianus mycclum gedrefed, and het hi ealle gebringan binnan \u00feam cwearterne eft, and het \u00dea wear\u00f0 se edcucode man betwux \u00feysum gefvllod binnan \u00feam cwearterne and gebad mid \u00feam Hi wurdon \u00fea gebrohte gebundene on racenteagum ealle to \u00feam tunnum and to \u00fe\u00e6re ontendnysse. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Martianus mid mycelre angsumnysse to \u00feam halgum werum and to his agenum suna, eala Eala \u00feu Iuliane, \u00fee awendest minne sunu swa \u00fe\u00e6t he min ne r\u00e6c\u00f0 ne eac \u00fe\u00e6re meder. \u00dea com seo modor mid mycelre sarnysse and ealle hyre hyredmen to \u00fe\u00e6re heofunga, and manega o\u00f0re \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s deman sunu to his dreorigan f\u00e6der, Ne \u00feurfe ge us bem\u00e6nan ne urne si\u00fe bewepan, We fara\u00f0 \u00f0urh \u00fe\u00e6t fyr unforhte \u00feurh God, and we ansunde becuma\u00f0 eft to eowrum gesih\u00feum. \u00deonne \u00feu me eft gesihst gesundne of \u00feam fyre, ge\u00feafa \u00fe\u00e6t min modor me gespr\u00e6can, and sume \u00fereo Ic wene \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ne forleosa na\u00f0or ne hi ne me. \u00dea wear\u00f0 seo modor on mode geblissod, and se f\u00e6der cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6s cnapan willan wolde \u00dea het se dema his gingran \u00feis don, and eode mid his wife aweg to his huse, for \u00fean \u00fee he ne mihte \u00dea het se undergerefa hi ealle gebringan into \u00f0am tunnum and ontendan hi mid acuman, and mid wuda \u00d0a stodan \u00fea halgan hale",
